## /etc/tor/torrc — Aska Dead Drop relay (onion-only). Tor is a CLIENT + onion service here; no relaying.
SocksPort 0
ClientOnly 1
Log notice file /dev/null
SafeLogging 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/aska-drop/
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 4567 127.0.0.1:4567
HiddenServiceNumIntroductionPoints 3
# DoS defences (RLY-07)
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSRatePerSec 25
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSBurstPerSec 200
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServicePoWQueueRate 250
HiddenServicePoWQueueBurst 2500
# Vanguards-lite is default in tor >= 0.4.7; for full vanguards install the `vanguards` add-on (see runbook).
